                "jsonStringBodyContent": "\n{\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are an accounting tutor for college students. Generate one financial accounting study tip. Randomly select ONE topic from this list: Depreciation, Accrual Accounting, Adjusting Journal Entries, Revenue Recognition, Inventory Valuation, Accounts Receivable, Bad Debt Expense, Financial Statements, Bonds Payable, Stockholders' Equity, Consolidated Financial Statements, Internal Controls, Audit Evidence, Accounts Payable, or Statement of Cash Flows. Do not always choose the first topic. Vary the selected topic between requests when possible. Do not generate personal budgeting topics. Provide a beginner-friendly definition, a realistic accounting example, one multiple-choice practice question with four answer choices (A, B, C, D), and the correct answer with a short explanation. Return a JSON object containing exactly six string fields: topic, definition, example, question, choices, answer. Format choices as A, B, C, and D on separate lines.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generationConfig\": {\n    \"responseMimeType\": \"application/json\",\n    \"temperature\": 1.2\n  }\n}\n",
